  "referenceNumber": "RUS3747",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that IMO 9344411 (“GALLE ENERGY”) is involved in an activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. Namely, 9344411 is, or is likely to be, involved in carrying liquefied natural gas that originated in Russia from a place in Russia to a third country. \n",
